12
01:02:31,578 --> 01:02:37,578
Baby's Day Out is a 1994 American adventure comedy film directed by Patrick Read Johnson
and written by John Hughes, who also served as producer with Richard Vane.

13
01:07:44,210 --> 01:07:50,210
Starring Joe Mantegna, Lara Flynn Boyle, Joe Pantoliano, and Brian Haley, the film centers on a wealthy baby's abduction by
three criminals, his subsequent escape and adventure through Chicago while being pursued by the criminals.

14
01:12:56,842 --> 01:13:02,842
Released on July 1, 1994, by 20th Century Fox in the United States, the film was a
box-office bomb, grossing only $30 million against a $48 million budget.

15
01:18:09,473 --> 01:18:15,473
Despite being panned by critics, it has since gained a cult following.

16
01:23:22,105 --> 01:23:28,105
Baby's Day Out was a commercial success in India.

17
